CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/b/ae com/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/canvasgl/TextureAliasRegion
	COMMENT TextureAliasRegion - one bitmap packed into a TextureAlias' atlas (also a BasicTexture so it can be drawn directly). Fields, all assigned by TextureAlias.a(Bitmap): renderTarget (the atlas - the region shares its GL texture, so textureId is copied from it), offsetX/offsetY (tile position inside the atlas) and the matching normalized coords u/v (offsetX/textureWidth, offsetY/textureHeight) plus the atlas size (textureWidth/textureHeight/invTextureWidth/invTextureHeight copied from the render target) and sourceWidth/sourceHeight of the original bitmap. [field names verified from code]
	FIELD l renderTarget Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/b/ad;
	FIELD m u F
	FIELD n v F
	FIELD o offsetX I
	FIELD p offsetY I
